fix: make Recruiting location filter truly optional and non-blocking

Location filter is now completely optional - searches work with or without it.

Changes:
- Recruiting.tsx: Only include location/radius params when filter is set
- placesProxy.ts: Only send radius parameter when location is provided
- RecruitingSearchFilters.tsx: Update UI messaging to clarify optional nature
- Add "Location Filter (Optional)" label in UI

Behavior:
- Without location: /api/places-search?q=... (text-only search, broad results)
- With location: /api/places-search?q=...&location=...&radius=... (geo-filtered)
- Users can toggle location filter on/off and re-search works correctly

No breaking changes - server already supports optional location parameter.

Files changed:
- src/components/Recruiting.tsx
- src/lib/google/placesProxy.ts
- src/components/RecruitingSearchFilters.tsx
- RECRUITING_LOCATION_OPTIONAL.md (new documentation)
